<section class="section"><div class="container">
  <div class="dark-strip"><h3>Fixed rules for all content on the site</h3><p>No promised outcomes, no guarantees, no absolute superlatives · no before/after photos on any public page — only inside Medical Information, behind the attestation and the protection layer · no named competitor comparisons and no prices · the product is dispensed and injected by a physician only, never sold to individuals · every published figure has a source in the technical file, and no promotional material is used before review.</p></div>
</div></section>

